0:	Peakshaving input		Fixed current <0\n3. SoC > target, output current < 0:	Peakshaving input		Fixed current >0\n4. SoC > target, output current > 0:	Battery discharging priority		Fixed current >0 \n\n\n">
0:	Peakshaving input		Fixed current <0\n3. SoC > target, output current < 0:	Peakshaving input		Fixed current >0\n4. SoC > target, output current > 0:	Battery discharging priority		Fixed current >0 \n\n\n">
